  err|
  err| deploy: error: no such option: -f
  [exit 2]
> usage
  | Usage: deploy [options]
  |
> version
  | deploy 1.0
== callbacks
> parser prog=etl
> option --tags action=callback type=string callback=csv help=comma separated
  --tags: action=callback type=string dest=tags nargs=1
> option -V,--values action=callback callback=vararg dest=vals
  -V/--values: action=callback type=None dest=vals nargs=1
> option -a action=callback callback=check_order
  -a: action=callback type=None dest=None nargs=1
> option -b action=store_true
  -b: action=store_true type=None dest=b nargs=None
> option --note action=callback callback=record type=string
  --note: action=callback type=string dest=note nargs=1
> option --pair action=callback callback=record type=int nargs=2
  --pair: action=callback type=int dest=pair nargs=2
> option --flag action=callback callback=record
  --flag: action=callback type=None dest=None nargs=1
> parse ['--tags', 'a,b,,c', '-V', '1', '-2', '3.5', 'x', '-b', 'y']
  | values: {'tags': ['a', 'b', '', 'c'], 'vals': ['1', '-2', '3.5', 'x'], 'b': True, 'note': None, 'pair': None}
  | args: ['y']
> parse ['-V', '--tags', 'q']
  | values: {'tags': ['q'], 'vals': [], 'b': None, 'note': None, 'pair': None}
  | args: []
> parse ['-V', '1e3', '-inf', '-nan', '--', '-x']
